  "source": "Mainnet's genesis cellbase 0xe2fb199810d49a4d8beec56718ba2593b665db9d52299a0f9e6e75416d73ff5c as the activity route sends it since lane feed part 4: every party by its short id (the first 20 bytes of its lock hash, with its tags) in lock-hash order, and the five largest CKB changes drawn (a cellbase has no fee payer). Derived from the chain spec (ckb-resource 0.119.0, specs/mainnet.toml) by the genesis cellbase layout (ckb-chain-spec 0.119.0, build_cellbase_transaction: the genesis cell, 4 system cells, the special issued cell, 665 issued cells; 671 outputs) and the indexer's party rules (a party is a lock; its CKB change the capacity of its outputs, its used change their occupied capacity; every party tagged as a cellbase's, 32, and the system cells' party, whose Type ID cells are type calls, 64 too). Checked against every captured value: the three parties the 2026-11-12 capture kept (address, lock hash, CKB and used change, lock kind), the special cell and the zero lock as tx 1's capture names them, 667 parties and 33,600,000,000 CKB in all.",
